OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWrong cat may have been buried
OL,4,Aafter mix-up at vets
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead vet Susan Turner apologised for
OL,7,FDowns' distress. She said it was the
OL,8,Fpractice's policy to not release the
OL,9,Fbodies of stray cats to members of the
OL,10,Fpublic in case the owner came forward
OL,11,Fbut in this case an exception had been
OL,12,Fmade as a "goodwill gesture".
